Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnNQAZZCOB\bord5\pos(960,842.67)\c&HD78240&\3c&HFAFCFB&}【Cos名 葵】
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,EpTitle,,0,0,0,,我今晚没有打算睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.66,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那我往那边去和凉香小姐他们会合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:13.31,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,先走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:14.27,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.45,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,有点太早到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.74,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,旭先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.66,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,会是怎样的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,真是期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:51.20,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}アオイハル 続いてく未来
