Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:51.20,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}稚嫩的青春 延续向未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:52.66,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}平凡无奇 平凡无奇 今天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:54.14,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和你在一起 Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:11.51,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:17.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:21.90,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:27.80,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:30.28,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:35.70,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:41.29,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:46.59,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:52.68,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七彩的明天 正在呼唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.47,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}即使没有 路标
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:58.22,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有不安 就一起分担
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.98,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有你在 永远
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.80,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来 笑一个吧 Hi-Five
